## Usage

Keep the options reference stable so the search index is not rebuilt on every render.

```tsx
import { useState } from "react";
import { Input } from "./Input";

const CITIES = [
  "Amsterdam",
  "Athens",
  "Barcelona",
  "Berlin",
  "Boston",
  "London",
  "Los Angeles",
  "New York",
  "Paris",
  "Tokyo",
];

export default function Example() {
  const [city, setCity] = useState("");

  return (
    <form
      onSubmit={(event) => {
        event.preventDefault();
        alert(`Selected city: ${city}`);
      }}
    >
      <Input
        label="City"
        name="city"
        options={CITIES}
        value={city}
        onChange={setCity}
        placeholder="Start typing a city…"
        required
      />

      <button type="submit">Submit</button>
    </form>
  );
}
```

### Behavior and performance

- **Matching:** ignores case, surrounding whitespace, and Unicode compatibility differences. Results are alphabetically ordered; blank and normalized duplicate options are removed.
- **Validation:** errors appear after blur or attempted submission, then update while typing. Unknown values are invalid unless `allowCustomValue` is enabled.
- **Keyboard:** arrows navigate, Enter selects, Escape dismisses, and Tab leaves without implicitly selecting.
- **Search:** index construction is approximately `O(n log n)` when options change; each prefix lookup uses `O(log n)` comparisons. Matching options are not copied into another array.
- **Rendering:** only visible rows, overscan rows, and the active option are mounted. Every match remains available through scrolling.
- **Very large datasets:** for millions of options, build/search the index in a worker or on the server. Virtualization reduces DOM work, not the cost of initially loading and indexing the data.

For production, test keyboard behavior and virtualized-list announcements with your supported browser/screen-reader combinations.

Кнопку подключай **между цифровым пином D2 и GND (минусом)**. К плюсу подключать не нужно: в коде используется `INPUT_PULLUP` — встроенная подтяжка входа.

```text
D2 ───── кнопка ───── GND
```

При нажатии мяч и обе ракетки вернутся в начальное положение. Это **рестарт игры**, а не полная перезагрузка Arduino. Добавлена защита от дребезга контактов.

### Готовый код

```cpp
#include <SPI.h>
#include <Wire.h>
#include <Adafruit_GFX.h>
#include <Adafruit_SSD1306.h>

#define JOYSTICK1_X A0
#define JOYSTICK1_Y A1
#define JOYSTICK2_X A2
#define JOYSTICK2_Y A3

#define RESTART_BUTTON 2  // Кнопка между D2 и GND

const unsigned long PADDLE_RATE = 33;
const unsigned long BALL_RATE = 40;
const uint8_t PADDLE_HEIGHT = 8;
const uint8_t BALL_SIZE = 3;

#define SCREEN_WIDTH 128
#define SCREEN_HEIGHT 32

#define OLED_RESET 4
Adafruit_SSD1306 display(
    SCREEN_WIDTH, SCREEN_HEIGHT, &Wire, OLED_RESET
);

uint8_t ball_x = 64;
uint8_t ball_y = 16;

// Направление может быть +1 или -1
int8_t ball_dir_x = 1;
int8_t ball_dir_y = 1;

unsigned long ball_update;
unsigned long paddle_update;

const uint8_t CPU_X = 12;
uint8_t cpu_y = 8;

const uint8_t PLAYER_X = 115;
uint8_t player_y = 8;

// Защита от дребезга кнопки
const unsigned long DEBOUNCE_DELAY = 30;
unsigned long lastButtonChange = 0;
bool lastButtonReading = HIGH;
bool buttonState = HIGH;

void drawCourt();
void restartGame();
bool restartPressed();

void setup() {
    pinMode(RESTART_BUTTON, INPUT_PULLUP);

    if (!display.begin(SSD1306_SWITCHCAPVCC, 0x3C)) {
        while (true) {
            // Не удалось инициализировать дисплей
        }
    }

    restartGame();
}

void loop() {
    if (restartPressed()) {
        restartGame();
        return;
    }

    bool update = false;
    unsigned long time = millis();

    int joy1_y = analogRead(JOYSTICK1_Y);
    int joy2_y = analogRead(JOYSTICK2_Y);

    if (time > ball_update) {
        uint8_t new_x = ball_x + ball_dir_x;
        uint8_t new_y = ball_y + ball_dir_y;

        if (new_y == 0 || new_y == 31 - BALL_SIZE) {
            ball_dir_y = -ball_dir_y;
            new_y += ball_dir_y + ball_dir_y;
        }

        if (new_x == CPU_X &&
            new_y >= cpu_y &&
            new_y <= cpu_y + PADDLE_HEIGHT) {
            ball_dir_x = -ball_dir_x;
            new_x += ball_dir_x + ball_dir_x;
        }

        if (new_x == PLAYER_X &&
            new_y >= player_y &&
            new_y <= player_y + PADDLE_HEIGHT) {
            ball_dir_x = -ball_dir_x;
            new_x += ball_dir_x + ball_dir_x;
        }

        display.fillRect(
            ball_x, ball_y, BALL_SIZE, BALL_SIZE, BLACK
        );
        display.fillRect(
            new_x, new_y, BALL_SIZE, BALL_SIZE, WHITE
        );

        ball_x = new_x;
        ball_y = new_y;

        ball_update += BALL_RATE;
        update = true;
    }

    if (time > paddle_update) {
        paddle_update += PADDLE_RATE;

        display.drawFastVLine(
            CPU_X, cpu_y, PADDLE_HEIGHT, BLACK
        );

        if (joy1_y < 400 && cpu_y > 1) {
            cpu_y--;
        }
        if (joy1_y > 600 && cpu_y < 31 - PADDLE_HEIGHT) {
            cpu_y++;
        }

        display.drawFastVLine(
            CPU_X, cpu_y, PADDLE_HEIGHT, WHITE
        );

        display.drawFastVLine(
            PLAYER_X, player_y, PADDLE_HEIGHT, BLACK
        );

        if (joy2_y < 400 && player_y > 1) {
            player_y--;
        }
        if (joy2_y > 600 && player_y < 31 - PADDLE_HEIGHT) {
            player_y++;
        }

        display.drawFastVLine(
            PLAYER_X, player_y, PADDLE_HEIGHT, WHITE
        );

        update = true;
    }

    if (update) {
        display.display();
    }
}

// Возвращает true один раз при нажатии кнопки
bool restartPressed() {
    bool reading = digitalRead(RESTART_BUTTON);
    unsigned long now = millis();

    if (reading != lastButtonReading) {
        lastButtonChange = now;
    }

    lastButtonReading = reading;

    if (now - lastButtonChange >= DEBOUNCE_DELAY) {
        if (reading != buttonState) {
            buttonState = reading;

            // При INPUT_PULLUP нажатие соответствует LOW
            if (buttonState == LOW) {
                return true;
            }
        }
    }

    return false;
}

// Начать игру заново
void restartGame() {
    ball_x = 64;
    ball_y = 16;
    ball_dir_x = 1;
    ball_dir_y = 1;

    cpu_y = 8;
    player_y = 8;

    display.clearDisplay();
    drawCourt();

    display.drawFastVLine(
        CPU_X, cpu_y, PADDLE_HEIGHT, WHITE
    );
    display.drawFastVLine(
        PLAYER_X, player_y, PADDLE_HEIGHT, WHITE
    );
    display.fillRect(
        ball_x, ball_y, BALL_SIZE, BALL_SIZE, WHITE
    );

    display.display();

    unsigned long now = millis();
    ball_update = now + BALL_RATE;
    paddle_update = now + PADDLE_RATE;
}

void drawCourt() {
    display.drawRect(
        0, 0, SCREEN_WIDTH, SCREEN_HEIGHT, WHITE
    );
}
```

**Важно:** у обычной кнопки нет полярности. Если у неё четыре ножки, они обычно соединены попарно внутри. Подключай D2 и GND к выводам **из разных пар**, которые замыкаются только при нажатии. Используй обычную кнопку без фиксации.

処理の流れと変数の役割が分かりやすくなるように整理しました。既存の検証順序・エラーメッセージ・レスポンスは維持しています。

```typescript
import bcrypt from "bcrypt";
import {
  serializerCompiler,
  validatorCompiler,
} from "fastify-type-provider-zod";
import { z } from "zod";

import { validateAuthUser } from "@/utils/authCheck";
import type { FastifyPluginAsyncTypeProvider } from "@/utils/fastify";
import { prisma } from "@/utils/prisma";
import { changePassword } from "@/utils/user";

const updateUserPasswordSchema = z.object({
  password: z.string(),
  new_password: z.string(),
  new_password_confirmation: z.string(),
});

const updateUserPasswordRoute: FastifyPluginAsyncTypeProvider = async (
  fastify
) => {
  fastify.setSerializerCompiler(serializerCompiler);
  fastify.setValidatorCompiler(validatorCompiler);

  fastify.patch(
    "/",
    {
      schema: {
        body: updateUserPasswordSchema,
      },
    },
    async (request, reply) => {
      const authenticatedUser = validateAuthUser(request.user);
      const {
        password: currentPassword,
        new_password: newPassword,
        new_password_confirmation: newPasswordConfirmation,
      } = request.body;

      const user = await prisma.users.findUnique({
        where: { id: authenticatedUser.id },
      });

      if (!user) {
        throw fastify.httpErrors.notFound("ユーザー情報がありません");
      }

      // 現在のパスワードを照合する
      const isCurrentPasswordValid = await bcrypt
        .compare(currentPassword, user.password)
        .catch(() => {
          throw fastify.httpErrors.internalServerError();
        });

      if (!isCurrentPasswordValid) {
        throw fastify.httpErrors.badRequest("現在のパスワードが異なります");
      }

      // 新しいパスワードの入力内容を検証する
      if (currentPassword === newPassword) {
        throw fastify.httpErrors.badRequest(
          "新しいパスワードは現在のパスワードと違うものを入力してください"
        );
      }

      if (newPassword !== newPasswordConfirmation) {
        throw fastify.httpErrors.badRequest(
          "新しいパスワードが一致しません"
        );
      }

      await changePassword({
        user_id: authenticatedUser.id,
        password: newPassword,
      });

      return reply.send("OK");
    }
  );
};

export default updateUserPasswordRoute;
```

### 主な変更点

- **変数名を具体化**  
  `result` を `isCurrentPasswordValid` にするなど、値の意味が分かる名前に変更しました。
- **リクエストの値を分割代入**  
  APIのフィールド名はそのままに、処理内では `currentPassword` などの読みやすい名前を使っています。
- **不要な `new Promise` を削除**  
  `bcrypt.compare` のPromise形式を使い、照合時のエラーを500エラーに変換する処理は維持しました。
- **不要な `else` を削除**  
  エラー時には `throw` で処理が終了するため、検証を独立した `if` にしました。
- **未使用のimportを削除**  
  元のコードで使われていない `validateRequestPassword` を削除しました。

